  m_Name: Apprentices' Notes 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  journalText: "Apprentices' Notes 1\n\n\nCORE and TRIP-OIL - basic notes (don't
    forget this stuff!)\r\n\r\n- CORE = central reactor of Hephastoria - it powers
    almost everything!\r\n- supervisor Derrick said that if we lose the CORE, we
    lose the city!\r\n- extracts TRIP-OIL from the depths of the mountain \n   (it
    glows with a weird orange-golden color\u2026 I\u2019ve seen nothing like it before\u2026)\r\n-
    cleans the extracted oil constantly and pumps it into the city \r\n- TRIP-OIL
    has insane efficiency! (3 times more powerful than regular oil!)\r\n- needs constant
    cooling and regulation - pressure spikes = BOOM!\r\n- only licensed engineers
    may access the control unit\r\n\n"
  textAudio: {fileID: 0}
